  "notes": [
    "¿Me regala…? (\"will you gift me…?\") is the everyday Colombian way to ask for something, even in a shop where you pay.",
    "Con mucho gusto (\"with much pleasure\") is the usual Colombian answer to gracias. De nada also works.",
    "Esfero is Colombian for a pen. Elsewhere you hear bolígrafo or pluma."
